    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολακτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kick off</i> or <i>away, shake off,</i>
			
